# 詞: 銀包

1. 我今朝出門口先發現銀包唔見咗，搞到要返轉頭搵。 (I only found out this morning that my wallet was missing when I left home, so I had to go back and look for it.)
2. 佢個銀包入面有好多現金，唔好咁大意亂咁擺。 (There's a lot of cash in his wallet, don't be so careless and leave it lying around.)
3. 你有冇見過我個銀包？我記得琴日仲擺喺呢度嘅。 (Have you seen my wallet? I remember it was still here yesterday.)
4. 個銀包咁舊都仲用緊，你都真係節儉。 (You're still using such an old wallet, you're really frugal.)
5. 佢喺巴士度執到個銀包，即刻交咗去警署。 (He found a wallet on the bus and immediately handed it in to the police station.)
6. 買嘢嗰陣先發現銀包冇帶，好唔好意思咁叫朋友幫手畀錢。 (I only realised I hadn't brought my wallet when I was buying something, so I felt embarrassed asking my friend to pay for me.)
7. 呢個銀包係佢送畀我嘅生日禮物，我好鍾意。 (This wallet was a birthday present from him, I really like it.)
8. 銀包入面除咗錢，仲有身份證同埋幾張卡。 (Besides money, there's also my ID card and a few cards in the wallet.)
9. 佢個銀包俾人偷咗，連八達通都冇埋，好慘。 (His wallet was stolen, and he even lost his Octopus card, how unfortunate.)
10. 記得檢查清楚銀包先好落車，唔好漏低嘢。 (Remember to check your wallet carefully before getting off the bus, don't leave anything behind.)

完成10句例句
